  "limits": [
    "The paired fixture assigns no registered berth, roommate identity or final player-cabin host; 400 crew including the player remains unchanged",
    "Source photo shows stacked bunks, but this first frame does not implement stacking, a ladder, upper guard or proven room headroom",
